> Will this also affect items in bags? That would call for a new sort of
> fireproof bag.

It effects bags and everything in them. Actually there is a pretty
nasty bug with that. Currently if the bag burns, then everything in
the bag burns too, even if the stuff inside is fireproof. It's pretty
unfair, and I intend to fix it... but I haven't yet. Wishing for a
fireproof bag of holding works, but I don't know of any ways to
fireproof a bag normally. I might just make it so that confused
enchant weapon works on wielded non-weapons. I can't think of why it
shouldn't. But anyway, I'd recommend just not going into lava, even if
you have fire resistance. I recently lost a character by falling into
the lava with only intrinsic fire resistance, I was a bit unlucky =96 it
was taking heaps of turns to crawl out of the lava. (I fell in because
I had teleportitis and I wasn't being careful enough...)

